Description: AI-native bash-compatible shell (niu)
 Niubash is a native shell that runs Bash-compatible commands without
 WSL or a virtual machine. It embeds the rubash language engine (GNU
 bash 5.3 as its oracle) and the ruline line editor (GNU readline
 8.x compatible).
 .
 On Linux, external commands come from the system's own coreutils;
 this package installs /usr/bin/niu only and does not touch
 /usr/bin/bash.

